# Code owners for PTF Core.
# GitHub auto-requests a review from the owner(s) on every PR touching a matching
# path. Combined with the branch ruleset's "Require review from Code Owners",
# this makes maintainer sign-off mandatory before a PR can merge.
#
# IMPORTANT: @ptf-arma/maintainers must exist as a team WITH write access to this
# repo, or the code-owner requirement can never be satisfied and PRs will be
# unmergeable. If you haven't created the team yet, temporarily replace it with
# your own handle (e.g. @matthawkins2) until the team exists.

# Everything defaults to the maintainers team.
*   @ptf-arma/maintainers

# (Optional) Narrow ownership later, e.g.:
# /addons/PTF_Aircraft/   @ptf-arma/aircraft-team
# /tools/ /.github/        @ptf-arma/maintainers
